 * Business context:
 *    Soft deletion allows for compliance hold and auditability of log entries without destroying data.
 *    Only authorized admin users may perform this operation, which should be fully logged/audited by the system.
 *    Deleted logs must not appear in ordinary operational log listings post-deletion.
