 * 5. (Optional) Attempt to create a duplicate (same session_anon_id + event_type) if uniqueness is enforced, and expect error or success depending on business logic.
 * 6. Attempt to create an event while not logged in (no admin JWT) and expect a permission error.
 * 7. (Optional) Attempt to create event as non-admin if API supports multiple roles, should expect error (not implemented if only admin allowed through API structure).
