 *   5. Member B successfully upvotes the post.
 *   6. Member B attempts a duplicate vote (should fail).
 *   7. Negative test for invalid vote_value input is omitted because such a call cannot be constructed without TypeScript compilation error - as per E2E instructions, such scenarios are not implemented here.
