 * 4. As the same member, add a comment to the post
 * 5. Delete (soft-delete) the comment as its author/member
 * 6. Check that the soft-deleted comment entity has deleted_at set (non-null)
 * 7. Confirm comment and author/post linkage remain consistent
 * (Does not cover: verifying audit/moderator visibility or list exclusion, due to API constraints)
 */
export async function test_api_comment_member_self_delete_success(
